<title>MOROCCO: French ACCOR to sign accord for $100 mln fund.</title>
<headline>French ACCOR to sign accord for $100 mln fund.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French group Accor to sign convention with Morocco on Thursday to set up a $100 million international fund aimed at upgrading current tourism projects, a senior official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The French group senior managers, which will be received by His Majesty King Hassan on Thursday, will sign a convention with the government aimed at establishing a $100 million international investment fund,&quot; the official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The convention covers investments in Moroccan existing tourism's assets and creating new projects, he added.</p>
</text>
